{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterDihedralDescent","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TwFromMatsumoto"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.exists_Tw_An","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.exists_Tw_An","kind":"theorem","line":262,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L262-L272","doc":"**The `T_w` basis map for the type-`A` Hecke algebra.**\n\nThis is the arc's target: `H_n(q)` for the symmetric group, with `T_w` defined on every element of\n`W` and agreeing with the word product on every reduced word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.matsumoto_An","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.matsumoto_An","kind":"theorem","line":255,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L255-L260","doc":"**Matsumoto's theorem for type `A`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.An_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.An_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L251-L253","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.An_le_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.An_le_three","kind":"theorem","line":247,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L247-L249","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.exists_Tw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.exists_Tw","kind":"theorem","line":228,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L228-L238","doc":"**The `T_w` basis map exists**, for every Coxeter system, with no hypothesis.\n\n`TwFromMatsumoto.exists_Tw_of_matsumoto` was stated conditionally on Matsumoto; the condition is\nnow discharged. `Tw` agrees with the word product on every reduced word, which is what a basis\nindexed by `W` through reduced expressions means. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.matsumoto'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.matsumoto'","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L218-L222","doc":"The convenient form: no explicit length bookkeeping. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.matsumoto","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.matsumoto","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L112-L216","doc":"**Matsumoto's theorem**, conditional on the rank-two order data.\n\nAny two reduced words for the same element are related by a finite chain of braid moves. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.altWord_eq_alternatingWord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.Matsumoto.altWord_eq_alternatingWord","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/Matsumoto.lean#L79-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@i